{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/5a8ec38963e947b733b5136b13c8f213.avif?t=1772995905\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/59cbc1148a67f023ceb88202af037d90.poster.avif?t=1772995905\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/59cbc1148a67f023ceb88202af037d90.webm?t=1772995905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your trusty d6 and journey into a dreamy \u201990s-infused turn-based roguelike. Create wild synergies with loads of unlockable gear and roll for victory in snappy 30-minute runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/1d8dcece484e7bbf4d600aabe82785a1.avif?t=1772995905\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/d93e982bd041f9f94e18bb7388cb29b7.poster.avif?t=1772995905\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/d93e982bd041f9f94e18bb7388cb29b7.webm?t=1772995905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>degenerate combos</strong> to break the game with <strong>new</strong> <strong>unlocks</strong> every time you wake up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable classes to conquer your dream foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 equipment cards to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 memories to make battles easier\u2026 or weirder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 different snacks to boost your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 30 minute runs, try every combination</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/42c8541499c7d8e3a2d91f1b7da6e89a.avif?t=1772995905\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And decorate it with nostalgic \u201990s memorabilia. Retro video games, rad movie posters, sick skateboards \u2013 everything you need to survive Y2K.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/f378bfb669f23629d2e939643998d1dc.poster.avif?t=1772995905\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/extras/f378bfb669f23629d2e939643998d1dc.webm?t=1772995905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3325390?t=1772995905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772995905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/11737e2661d1a6ed5a4094b24c32d2cc60878bc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772995905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325390/11737e2661d1a6ed5a4094b24c32d2cc60878bc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772995905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos